                    <signifLet xml:id="m-9419d831-12f4-4e4a-a068-304c585fbc95" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-c6d30d3f-a228-454e-b6ba-91d01a4d1f1f" facs="#m-25790d9f-1448-4011-9da2-e3e9b1468985" form="finalis" /><custos xml:id="m-894cc5ed-daef-4b31-91b3-a43e15c2e804" facs="#m-fd7710d9-34bf-4a05-8616-538de51ecac7" pname="g" oct="3" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-890c0642-a1ba-4184-b850-b9540dded062"><lg xml:id="m-621dacbb-c274-4152-a1b9-6fb9ab43ca31"><l xml:id="m-d13ff859-bc0f-4b80-8dc6-ab3778278437" facs="#m-1c36af60-491f-4d0d-b1dd-98fae470a57b" label="ambiguous">1844</l><l xml:id="m-b3530b9a-63b4-4958-9cdc-fc3fbc2fa5af" facs="#m-09b300a6-4c41-41dd-b386-6adf6065e91f" label="text-like">Administration of Confrmation.</l><l xml:id="m-e5cda1ab-3f46-4a57-b7d3-5c6d17e34835" facs="#m-ae6c40ad-93f0-4b5f-88e6-c16ec0c408c1" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. R. Et cum spíritu tuo.</l><l xml:id="m-f76b943e-a57c-4956-acb0-8412ae146266" facs="#m-27d463c8-b4da-4ba9-8cd6-3703921e005a" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-b4297954-35e0-489b-b50e-1490747285be" facs="#m-76d83aef-3802-459a-8500-b014ef30335d" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-9726d142-ea90-4bc5-a160-fb7d874d4db3" facs="#m-d5352287-ac3e-496c-a435-ecdd96297001" label="lyrics-like">IBsólve, quaésumus Dómine, áni-linter sanctos et eléctos tuos resus¬</l><l xml:id="m-00fd709a-6f87-473c-a3a0-1aa586a5145c" facs="#m-d5ddd99d-7bb8-4fb1-9fbf-8a309345fd23" label="lyrics-like">Al mas famulórum famularúmque citáti respirent. Per Christum Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-918a0037-beee-4dd9-941e-146c333fb9b1" facs="#m-d368e3c0-2a28-4fe4-b71b-8f8ae1aec254" label="lyrics-like">tuárum ab omni vinculo delictó- minum nostrum. E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-be7db4f2-c2e7-42b1-b5b6-1b94a84de803" facs="#m-d99d87b2-ebb2-4127-8720-89e1c241dad5" label="lyrics-like">rum; t ut in resurrectiónis glória*</l><l xml:id="m-a9d369cc-1b40-43e4-92ab-de70fac53758" facs="#m-6239e906-3f4a-43df-a369-3281ee2534c3" label="text-like">Ir the Sacrament of Confirmation is to be administered, see below.</l><l xml:id="m-60689053-2a3c-4ad4-ab13-1eefbf57b33a" facs="#m-e1bf1e15-ab53-4541-8eec-bc7d298279d3" label="text-like">At the end of the pastoral visit, the Bishop, standing before the Altar at the</l><l xml:id="m-520beab8-88af-4223-82b0-b1fce62d6f4b" facs="#m-a90697b0-e8ac-44bd-9336-328f05c9df06" label="lyrics-like">Epistle side, recites the Ps. De profúndis. mith Réquiem aetérnam. and the</l><l xml:id="m-be84018b-e847-4218-bce0-c14cb10431d5" facs="#m-364725b7-e299-4c54-958c-be7f3b0554cf" label="lyrics-like">Ant. Si iniquitátes. p. 1763.</l><l xml:id="m-b7ed7c51-85b7-402e-a9dd-6384af27b32a" facs="#m-1a265159-fda6-4d77-a569-8c9d6d0c9a09" label="lyrics-like">Páter nóster. etc. as on p. 1843.</l><l xml:id="m-87aa1044-6d05-48ec-a7db-b04c5b40fe79" facs="#m-c7463a60-4ebb-45ab-882d-c208dd8d03e2" label="lyrics-like">Prayer. Deus, cujus miseratióne. p. 1843</l><l xml:id="m-de2d6a62-7785-41a6-8495-29f6df208612" facs="#m-e60f4f04-18e9-40f3-94a2-1dfe788b78a0" label="text-like">The Administration of Confirmation.</l><l xml:id="m-bfc40743-f8a5-441e-bf1b-73b2e691ca04" facs="#m-75293fac-5fd3-4faf-8e82-79f5f4bc1610" label="lyrics-like">The Bishop : Spíritus Sanctus supervéniat in vos, et virtus Altíssimi</l><l xml:id="m-59631f73-0632-45aa-9f10-006c4957fd68" facs="#m-4846f6be-a4be-400e-983d-95fb39445dde" label="lyrics-like">custódiat vos a peccátis. H. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-913f466f-56ed-4a97-bf23-ea66b873d776" facs="#m-811cb93a-90d7-4016-ab73-91e8e12d2dc6" label="lyrics-like">v. Adjutórium nóstrum in nómine Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-98bdfbab-396a-4aa8-8410-b403600967d5" facs="#m-df039e24-f040-4ed1-98f0-13f11df68959" label="lyrics-like">R. Qui fécit caélum et térram.</l><l xml:id="m-0aeb9f9d-596f-4658-82f8-10425c891af9" facs="#m-faca0849-fd0a-49dc-8193-7279789b965b" label="lyrics-like">V. Dómine exáudi oratiónem méam. K. Et clámor méus ad te véniat.</l><l xml:id="m-de699e4f-3ff6-4ac1-8b28-1415001b1ff0" facs="#m-ffe839a0-3a3c-4dde-b3c1-4e724e35cfef" label="lyrics-like">V. Dóminus vobiscum. B. Et cum spiritu túo.</l><l xml:id="m-df119b84-fdd8-48f9-9e05-cedc80bcbf46" facs="#m-e7888d59-09f1-45b7-9b1e-1d3455396fcc" label="lyrics-like">Orémus.</l><l xml:id="m-3ed0b139-f5e4-4be5-852a-41a932470087" facs="#m-5170d277-a33c-462c-b876-5b0068eb0a19" label="text-like">Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-af1704e7-435b-4e54-9d45-24c3f233edbd" facs="#m-d792b8c1-8dde-40a3-a5c5-66d988300f28" label="lyrics-like">Mnípotens sempitérne Deus, qui  nem ómnium peccatórum;* emitte</l><l xml:id="m-88167e1f-0f48-467a-b833-bf7b5c0fd467" facs="#m-692119fd-9b61-4c3d-9016-8688e478004a" label="lyrics-like">U regenerâre dignátus es hos fá-lin eos septifórmem Spíritum tuum</l><l xml:id="m-c19b2172-6222-412c-a489-405b0e3d0dfa" facs="#m-b413e0cc-8bae-4a99-b948-27bb0976afdf" label="lyrics-like">mulos tuos ex aqua et Spiritu San-Sanctum Paráclitum de caelis.</l><l xml:id="m-f05f617d-55b3-4eb0-a640-701a673878a8" facs="#m-0b9175c1-1afd-4410-b19e-c8908ee85db3" label="lyrics-like">cto; t quique dedísti eis remissió- K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b73bcbcb-558e-495f-b06d-bce09730e650" facs="#m-6c78cd77-eb6a-496b-974b-8d7e632efeca" label="lyrics-like">Spiritum sapiéntiae, et intelléctus. E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-9fa9df0d-9352-41a9-bd71-2b313f19df7e" facs="#m-2c240df9-b1d7-4234-971d-71d431afb331" label="lyrics-like">Spiritum consilii, et fortitúdinis. E. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-cc94f79c-1701-4200-8527-1d9570d4a46a" facs="#m-24bacc34-2e6e-43c0-96de-174222b2b617" label="lyrics-like">Spíritum sciéntiae, et pietátis. R. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-f54c53b2-bd9d-400c-91c9-c2d527082c88" facs="#m-3d002925-44fc-435b-964b-fc47f4a06ffe" label="lyrics-like">H Dimple eos Spiritu timóris tui, strum Jesum Christum... in unitáte</l><l xml:id="m-65cb397b-33a7-4ed9-9b19-aacb8ccf676e" facs="#m-621c7586-35f9-4ec9-8d36-70aef743236c" label="lyrics-like">Il et consigna eos signo cru Fcis ejúsdem Spiritus Sancti Deus, per</l><l xml:id="m-e92b65f8-e636-40b5-83fd-3e6362b10dad" facs="#m-156b28d7-79c2-41c0-905e-8c8577c908a7" label="lyrics-like">Christi, in vitam propitiátus aẽtér¬ ómnia saécula saeculórum.</l><l xml:id="m-4fcef748-b4cf-438a-bdb4-345b1971e863" facs="#m-33608f74-96f8-438f-8cda-aec69bc4d83f" label="lyrics-like">nam. Per eúmdem Dóminum no¬</l><l xml:id="m-dc5443af-467d-436e-9f6b-9d56e06656d8" facs="#m-bc91e5e1-2911-4c48-a35f-0973ae6096dc" label="ambiguous">K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-81bfe765-43cc-440f-8aee-0b9acefbc3d9" facs="#m-89c04201-2b61-4dd3-835f-94ddda98e66e" label="text-like">When all are confirmed, the Bishon washes his hands mhile the follouine</l><l xml:id="m-d4cbadd7-c72d-4373-8fcf-861af1ef74e9" facs="#m-c44d3e82-249a-4cc0-aa57-676ae784f630" label="text-like">is sung:</l><l xml:id="m-d19efbc2-b42b-448c-b4eb-af35960fce4f" facs="#m-483f6e69-06ec-45f0-a465-ed91a9b74d1e" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-ca7e75ce-184d-4b66-8867-0fc6f1bf8434" facs="#m-571de8e3-b4ea-4adf-859f-e3d50e100c79" label="ambiguous">s. e</l><l xml:id="m-74f6fecb-15b9-41e3-ac24-9143add9ee8e" facs="#m-8ae8426f-2a3d-4010-9292-e2111589467f" label="lyrics-like">Onfírma hoc Dé¬ us “ quod operá-tus es in nó¬</l><l xml:id="m-79f0c92d-6979-4232-9710-9c48126aba0b" facs="#m-9824f5cd-e244-486a-818b-72cf9c4595e3" label="lyrics-like">bis, a témplo sáncto tú¬ quod est in Jerú-sa-lem.</l><l xml:id="m-1a6752a1-0e14-442b-aee0-03bcab972b23" facs="#m-04ddc007-fbdf-45c8-8ffb-a488a3d9a535" label="lyrics-like">V. Gló-ri-a Pátri, et Fi-li-o</l><l xml:id="m-8823080d-1ea3-45b0-8bec-982887fe1fe5" facs="#m-93a633b0-0ccd-4de0-9a9a-072f07aeda4c" label="lyrics-like">et Spi-rí-tu-i Sáncto.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>